083380","type":"quoted"}],"text":"LOVE the association btw Thomas Mann and Lu Xun here. Totally agree that there are similar problems in modernist thinking and aesthetics in play. https://t.co/fRBHLLHdzr","url":"https://x.com/adam_tooze/status/2113021485027885247"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113004053437222913","3_2113004080872181760","3_2113004098458890240","3_2113004118121803776"]},"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-21T20:27:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113004257771438209"],"id":"2113004257771438209","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":14623,"like_count":54,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":4},"text":"FORGET EMH, LET'S TALK ABOUT PMH\n\nIn today's newsletter, I wrote about our conversation with Professor James Robinson. And how while UChicago is often associated with the Efficient Markets Hypothesis, what we should really be talking more about is the Politics Matter Hypothesis https://t.co/ncOtJDvWEG","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113004257771438209"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-21T20:21:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113002787869180091"],"id":"2113002787869180091","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":205669,"like_count":694,"quote_count":34,"reply_count":76,"retweet_count":24},"text":"*META: ZUCKERBERG MAY RELOCATE FROM CALIFORNIA IF PROP 40 PASSES","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113002787869180091"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-21T20:06:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112998910717497749"],"id":"2112998910717497749","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":18988,"like_count":59,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112998672505983416","type":"quoted"}],"text":"$META +3.8% AH https://t.co/9GjHbRxpyj","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112998910717497749"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-21T20:05:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112998672505983416"],"id":"2112998672505983416","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":35996,"like_count":92,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":4},"text":"$META's new CAPEX outlook is roughly inline with its old CAPEX outlook, which is fine. But for the last few years, we've been accustomed to companies underestimating their future spending plans.\n\n*META SEES FY CAPEX $135B TO $145B, SAW $130B TO $145B","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112998672505983416"},{"author_id":"30034124","created_at":"2026-10-21T20:01:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112997611720298540"],"id":"2112997611720298540","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1713,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Fermilab's MAGNet Environment Simulator test platform will support cutting-edge research aimed at enabling the powerful magnets needed for future fusion energy systems.\nhttps://t.co/UOBgKIQAqz","url":"https://x.com/Fermilab/status/2112997611720298540"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-21T19:53:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112995659376976100"],"id":"2112995659376976100","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":22182,"like_count":127,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":3},"text":"Do we have ETFs that own perpetual futures that track Presidential approval ratings yet?","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112995659376976100"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112993761340907520"]},"author_id":"423769635","created_at":"2026-10-21T19:45:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112993768907628847"],"id":"2112993768907628847","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":10900,"like_count":71,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":28},"text":"Since late 2022, output per worker in the three most AI-intensive industries has grown 5% annually, more than double its historical pace and well above the 1.3% growth recorded across the rest of the private sect