d to the editors who made it happen. 🗞️ https://t.co/Ml3Kn4OOcC https://t.co/J9glEbQE5L","url":"https://x.com/Lingling_Wei/status/2112968586079744448"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112963399785037824"]},"author_id":"48463418","created_at":"2026-10-21T17:45:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112963402867826768"],"id":"2112963402867826768","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":3302,"like_count":42,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":13},"text":"Why is the sun's corona millions of degrees hotter than its surface? A study in Physical Review Letters used powerful lasers to recreate solar nanoflares in the lab and watch them heat plasma.\n\nRead the study: https://t.co/rSBNHJ1Ts4 https://t.co/qDk6XiMcjG","url":"https://x.com/APSphysics/status/2112963402867826768"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112962637281873920"]},"author_id":"702235316812275712","created_at":"2026-10-21T17:42:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112962663974350883"],"id":"2112962663974350883","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1885,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Here's a long-run view of the compression in pay across educational attainment:\n\nPremium for advanced degrees and penalty for not finishing HS shrinking meaningfully; not much change to middle rungs (HS diploma all the way to 4 year bachelor's degree) https://t.co/jcNlmT0h4x","url":"https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2112962663974350883"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-21T17:12:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112955228945539495"],"id":"2112955228945539495","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":51,"impression_count":44939,"like_count":326,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":14},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112837101108728136","type":"quoted"}],"text":"\"The leadership's children grew up being told they would inherit their fathers' positions. The Cultural Revolution destroyed that \"mini society\" and prevented the Party from degenerating into another imperial dynasty.\"\n\nBTW, who's the President of Chinese now and who was his dad https://t.co/wYlS91by9k","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112955228945539495"},{"author_id":"733647469305864195","created_at":"2026-10-21T17:03:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112952891405451471"],"id":"2112952891405451471","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":7134,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":9},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112750760790470909","type":"quoted"}],"text":"FX settlement -- a measure of foreign currency bought by both the PBOC and the state banks that historically tracks with actual intervention -- was quite strong in September.  I don't think the IMF can ignore this indicator and other signs of active currency management much https://t.co/4OjyUCOQhE","url":"https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2112952891405451471"},{"author_id":"702235316812275712","created_at":"2026-10-21T16:54:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112950678574506248"],"id":"2112950678574506248","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":7060,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112944717658734835","type":"quoted"}],"text":"This is gonna be great https://t.co/CSzHDIeeAI","url":"https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2112950678574506248"},{"author_id":"733647469305864195","created_at":"2026-10-21T16:49:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112949309981475017"],"id":"2112949309981475017","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":9255,"like_count":117,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":17},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112888387388526811","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Good chart\n\nThe steepness of the decline in Chinese domestic auto sales is shocking, and goes beyond the expiration of the incentives ...\n\nCalls into question the sustainability of current levels of auto investment as well. https://t.co/EI7iPhN9l9","url